%% Component diagram: module boundaries and dependency direction.
%% Nodes are Django apps, frontend packages, and external systems (PG, IdP).
%% This diagram is the authoritative source for the directory structure;
%% no separate architecture md file is maintained.
%% Template for Mermaid flowchart-based component view:

flowchart LR
    FE[frontend: <React|Vue> app]
    API[apps/<domain>.api]
    SVC[apps/<domain>.services]
    SEL[apps/<domain>.selectors]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    IDP[IdP / OIDC provider]

    FE -->|HTTP /api| API
    API --> SVC
    API --> SEL
    SVC --> DB
    SEL --> DB
    API -->|auth| IDP

%% Rules:
%% - One node per app from the research architecture summary.
%% - Edges are dependencies, labeled with the interaction kind.
%% - Direction matters: apps may not depend on the frontend; services do not
%%   import views; nothing imports settings from apps.
